' ============================================================================
' EdgeIteration_scripts__S4PromotionOfAnEdgeFix.puml
'
' Purpose : PlantUML sequence diagram for scenario S4 of the @NikolaiGogol /
'           _scripts edge-iteration workflow on @terra.
' RFC     : docs/rfc/RFC-0001-edge-iteration-workflow.md
' Scenarios: docs/rfc/RFC-0001-edge-iteration-scenarios.md (authoritative
'           analyst catalogue; this file renders the scenario below).
' Date    : 2026-10-29
' Base    : 004ee9e
'
' Split from the former single-file EdgeIteration_scripts.puml so each diagram renders to its
' own file. Render with: plantuml -tpng -tsvg docs/_diagrams/*.puml
'
' Shared facts:
'   source    = $HOME/.bookmarks/shared-projects/ChronoIndex/2026/ConvPlatProv-HomeServer__HomeAssistant/@NikolaiGogol
'   target    = /zterra/local-/Projects/@NikolaiGogol/_scripts
'   container = HomeServer__HomeAssistant.NikolaiGogol
'
' Phase 0 = deploy scripts as-is.
'   /zterra/local-/Projects/@NikolaiGogol/_scripts is a DEBUG SURFACE:
'   no bind mount, no compose change, tags [scripts, debug], and it is not
'   implied by `container`. It is not the deployment path.
'
' Style: one start/end block per scenario, autonumber per diagram,
'        participants declared only where used (cf. docs/Deploy#NixContainer.puml).
' ============================================================================

@startuml
autonumber
title S4 — Promotion of an edge fix

actor Operator
participant "Upstream repos\nUnix_dotfiles / Virt_scripts" as UpstreamRepos
participant "Pins" as Pins
participant "Control node" as ControlNode
participant "Ansible" as Ansible
participant "Terra (TOS 6)" as Terra
participant "Docker daemon" as Docker
participant "Container\nHomeServer__HomeAssistant.NikolaiGogol" as Container
participant "ScriptsDir\n/zterra/local-/Projects/@NikolaiGogol/_scripts" as ScriptsDir

Operator -> UpstreamRepos : commit the verified edge fix
UpstreamRepos --> Operator : commit sha
Operator -> Pins : refs-update REF=[commit sha]
Pins --> Operator : pin variable set to the 40-hex sha
Operator -> ControlNode : build the artifact from the pinned checkout
Operator -> Ansible : run the full authoritative deploy S0 (TAGS=image,container,scripts)
Ansible -> Terra : sync dependencies at the pin and load the content-tagged image
Terra -> Docker : docker import image as ds-omega/nikolaigogol with tag [sha12]
Docker -> Container : recreate HomeServer__HomeAssistant.NikolaiGogol from the new image
Ansible -> ScriptsDir : refresh _scripts only when the scripts tag is included
Container --> Operator : edge fix promoted, container-layer state discarded
Operator -> Terra : verify with S7; for VM definitions also run S6
note over UpstreamRepos, Container
  There is no copy-out path from the edge loop.
  The source commit is the only promotion artifact.
  A script-only change may leave the image unchanged; a VM-definition-only
  change still needs the domain redefined in S6.
end note
@enduml
